  "coupled": {
    "Barrel": "min(Bolt as fired, 0.01): short recoil, the barrel rides the carrier's first centimetre locked to its face, then stops, and the carrier brings it home (not when the carrier is pulled back on the charging handle)",
    "Bolt": "max(Bolt, Charger): the charging handle pushes the carrier back by its lug; the carrier never drags the handle (baked into every action)"
  },
